#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge3/scripts.inc:200
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge3_Text_CantYouSeeWereBusyHere"
msgid ""
"…What's that you want?\p"
"Can't you see we're kind of busy here?\n"
"Can't your business wait till later?$"
msgstr ""
"……你想干什么？\p"
"你没看到我们正忙着吗？\n"
"你的事不能等会儿再说吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge3/scripts.inc:205
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge3_Text_YouLookToughExplainGambling"
msgid ""
"…Huh?\n"
"You look to me like a tough TRAINER.\p"
"Heheh…\n"
"Listen, I have this proposition.\p"
"We have a little group going here,\n"
"and we play a little game with what\l"
"goes on in the BATTLE FRONTIER.\p"
"The rules are really simple.\p"
"First, we pick one of the facilities\n"
"in the BATTLE FRONTIER.\p"
"Then, we each pick a different TRAINER\n"
"who's taking that facility's challenge,\l"
"and bet with our Battle Points.\p"
"The guy who bet on the TRAINER with\n"
"the best record takes all the Battle\l"
"Points in the pool.\p"
"Sounds simple, huh?\n"
"So, anyway…$"
msgstr ""
"……嗯？\n"
"我看你像是个很厉害的训练家。\p"
"嘿嘿……\n"
"听着，我有个提议。\p"
"我们这里有个小团体，\n"
"拿对战开拓区里发生的事\l"
"玩一个小游戏。\p"
"规则非常简单。\p"
"首先，我们从对战开拓区\n"
"选出一座设施。\p"
"然后，每个人各挑一个\n"
"挑战那座设施的训练家，\l"
"用对战点数下注。\p"
"押中成绩最好的训练家的人，\n"
"就能拿走所有的对战点数。\p"
"听起来很简单吧？\n"
"总之呢……$"

