"So how about it?\l"
"How about entering that event for me?$"
msgstr ""
"我保证你也会有好处的。\n"
"所以，怎么样？\l"
"替我去参加那个比赛如何？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge3/scripts.inc:314
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge3_Text_SpotMeSomeBattlePoints"
msgid ""
"All right, that's perfect.\n"
"So, uh… How about spotting me some\l"
"of your Battle Points?\p"
"Trust me, I'll show you my gratitude\n"
"afterward.$"
msgstr ""
"好，太好了。\n"
"那么，呃……能不能借我一点\l"
"你的对战点数？\p"
"相信我，事后我一定会\n"
"好好报答你的。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge3/scripts.inc:321
