#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge3/scripts.inc:419
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge3_Text_NiceTryCantReturnPoints"
msgid ""
"Oh, it's you…\n"
"Nice try…\p"
"I hate to break it to you, but I can't\n"
"return your Battle Points…\p"
"I guess we'll have to let it motivate\n"
"us to try harder next time!$"
msgstr ""
"哦，是你啊……\n"
"辛苦了……\p"
"很遗憾地告诉你，\n"
"你的对战点数我还不了……\p"
"就让这次的失败激励我们\n"
"下次更加努力吧！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge3/scripts.inc:427
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge3_Text_HelloChampHeresYourPoints"
msgid ""
"Oh, yes!\n"
"Hello there, champ!\p"
"I knew you could!\n"
"I knew you would!\l"
"We're both big winners!\p"
"I'll return your Battle Points and,\n"
"of course, a little extra from me!$"
msgstr ""
"哦，太好了！\n"
"你好啊，冠军！\p"
"我就知道你行！\n"
"我就知道你能做到！\l"
"我们俩都是大赢家！\p"
"我会把对战点数还给你，\n"
"当然，还会再多给你一点！$"

