"easily to survive the BATTLE DOME…$"
msgstr ""
"那个训练家……\p"
"他实力不错，但太容易慌张，\n"
"在对战巨蛋里撑不下去的……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge3/scripts.inc:461
